From d0d280600bc30074d0aa04396052e1b892b0476c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:23:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Import CMU mocap: BVH donor, CMU retarget map, 67 combat
 and footwork takes

motion/bvh.rs parses BVH into a DonorLib (frame one, the cgspeed T-pose,
is the bind); retarget gains Mode::Cmu (bind-delta with CMU_MAP: LowerBack
/ Spine / Spine1 onto the three spine bones); the bank loads every
assets/anim/cmu/*.bvh as library cmu (tracks like cmu/135_02_empi).
tools/cmu/subset.py picks and downsamples the takes: karate kata, the
subject-144 martial arts session (blocks, kicks, punch sequences, spin
reaches), boxing, punch/kick sets, swordplay, footwork cuts and spins,
get-ups. Tests check every take parses with a T-pose bind and that
retargeted takes keep the body together and kick forward. LICENSES.md
records the source and terms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017RTuqxaQfwuvFPEJrcXYEk
